  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6605.01 Permit Required. Pursuant to RSA 107-D:3, I, no person shall transport high-level radioactive waste through the state until a permit has been issued in accordance with these rules.\n\nSource. #7287, eff 5-24-00; ss by #9154, eff 5-8-08",
